      501.8
    ],
    "text": "Declaration under Section 5",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.28,
      517.12,
      297.8,
      590.59
    ],
    "text": "I, Nalaka Jude Harin Fernando, Minister of Tourism and Lands do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.28,
      607.12,
      297.85,
      695.59
    ],
    "text": "An allotment of land, in total Extent of about 1.464 Hectare, depicted in the Advanced Tracing No. NU/WLP/93/261 dated 22.03.1999, prepard by the Surveyor-General, situated in the village of Pannala in Oya Palatha Korale Minor Division in Divisional Secretary's Division of Walapane in Nuwara Eliya District in Central Province and bounded as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.28,
      460.12,
      549.81,
      557.75
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot 'A' \u2013 Hapugolle Hena \u2013 Extent: about 1.464 Hectare North: Agala and Hapugolle Hena owned by Government; East: Adipara and Hapugolle Hena owned by Government; South: Adipara and Hapugolle Watta claimed by Y. M. Dingiri Banda; West: Hapugolle Watta, Hapugolle Wewa claimed by Y. M. Dingiri Banda and Agala.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.28,
      566.28,
      540.14,
      593.75
    ],
